(Section A ? Cloud Service Description) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(The Cloud Service is Quillhub Route Optimizer Pro, a cloud-based logistics-) Tj
T*
(optimization platform providing real-time route planning, fleet tracking,) Tj
T*
(delivery-window management, and standard API access \(the "Platform"\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section B ? Subscription Period and Renewal) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(  Effective Date:              [TO BE INSERTED UPON GO-LIVE]) Tj
T*
(  Initial Subscription Period: 24 months from the Effective Date) Tj
T*
(  Renewal Period:              successive 12-month periods) Tj
T*
(  Non-Renewal Notice Period:   90 days before the end of the then-current) Tj
T*
(                               Subscription Period) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  The Agreement will automatically renew for successive Renewal Periods of) Tj
T*
(  12 months each, unless either party delivers written notice of non-renewal) Tj
T*
(  to the other party's Notice Address at least 90 days before the end of the) Tj
T*
(  then-current Subscription Period, in accordance with Section 5.1 of the) Tj
T*
(  Standard Terms.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  "Written notice" means a notice delivered in accordance with Section 12.4) Tj
T*
(  of the Standard Terms. For the avoidance of doubt, informal communications) Tj
