(Section C ? Fees and Payment) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------) Tj
T*
(  Monthly Fee:     $18,500.00 \(Eighteen Thousand Five Hundred U.S. Dollars\)) Tj
T*
(  Payment Process: Invoicing. Quillhub will issue invoices on the first) Tj
T*
(                   business day of each calendar month for that month's Fee.) Tj
T*
(  Payment Period:  30 days from invoice date.) Tj
T*
(  Currency:        U.S. Dollars) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  Setup Fee:       $12,000.00 \(Twelve Thousand U.S. Dollars\), payable upon) Tj
T*
(                   execution of this Agreement. The Setup Fee is non-refundable.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section D ? Service Level) Tj
T*
(--------------------------) Tj
T*
(  з3.1  Uptime Commitment. Quillhub will make the Platform available at least) Tj
T*
(        ninety-nine and five-tenths percent \(99.5%\) of the minutes in each) Tj
T*
(        calendar month, not counting Scheduled Maintenance \(the "Vantage) Tj
T*
(        Uptime Target"\). "Scheduled Maintenance" means maintenance that) Tj
T*
(        Quillhub has notified Vantage Logistics about at least 48 hours in) Tj
T*
(        advance via email to the Customer's contact.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  з3.2  Service Credits. If the Monthly Uptime Percentage falls below the) Tj
T*
(        Vantage Uptime Target in any calendar month, Quillhub will credit) Tj
T*
(        Vantage Logistics ten percent \(10%\) of the Monthly Fee for that month) Tj
T*
(        against Vantage Logistics' next invoice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  з3.3  Credit Request. Vantage Logistics must request a service credit in) Tj
T*
(        writing within thirty \(30\) days after the end of the calendar month) Tj
T*
(        in which the Downtime occurred.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section E ? Exclusivity) Tj
T*
(-------------------------) Tj
T*
(  з4.1  Route Optimizer Exclusivity. During the Subscription Period, Quillhub) Tj
T*
(        grants Vantage Logistics the exclusive right to use the Route) Tj
T*
(        Optimizer platform \(including all tiers: Standard, Pro, and) Tj
T*
(        Enterprise\) within the Pacific Northwest third-party logistics sector) Tj
T*
(        \(defined as third-party logistics companies headquartered in the) Tj
T*
(        states of Washington and Oregon that provide warehousing and last-mile) Tj
T*
(        delivery services\). Quillhub will not license any tier of Route) Tj
T*
(        Optimizer to any other third-party logistics company headquartered in) Tj
T*
(        Washington or Oregon that provides warehousing and last-mile delivery) Tj
T*
(        services during the Subscription Period without Vantage Logistics') Tj
T*
(        prior written consent.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section F ? Liability) Tj
T*
(-----------------------) Tj
T*
(  General Cap Amount:  The total Fees paid or payable by Customer in the) Tj
T*
(                       twelve \(12\) months immediately preceding the claim.) Tj
T*
(  Unlimited Claims:    None specified.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section G ? Governing Law) Tj
T*
(---------------------------) Tj
T*
(  Governing Law:    State of Oregon) Tj
T*
(  Chosen Courts:    Federal and state courts located in Multnomah County,) Tj
T*
(                    Oregon) Tj
T*
() Tj
